ield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":30.7,"_gate_share_shrink":0.22739152062865098,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":null,"_gp_sbc_dilution":null,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":3.0000001e-05,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":0.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.333,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":33.3,"pf":[],"description_full":"Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides banking, leasing, securities, consumer finance, and other services in Japan, the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Asia, and Oceania. It operates through Wholesale Business Unit, Retail Business Unit, Global Business Unit, and Global Markets Business Unit segments. The Wholesale Business Unit segment offers bilateral loans, syndicated loans, commitment lines, structured finance, project finance, and nonrecourse loans; deposits and investment trusts; risk hedging services, including forward exchange contracts and derivatives; stand-by credit, and performance bond and credit guarantee services; remittance, cash management, trade finance, and supply chain finance services; merger and acquisition, and other advisory services; digital services; and equipment, operating and leveraged leasing services. The Retail Business Unit segment provides wealth management services, such as time deposits and foreign currency deposits, investment trusts, equities, bonds, insurance products, and trust services; credit card, installment, and transaction services; and consumer finance and housing loans. The Global Business Unit segment offers loans, deposits, clearing, trade finance, project finance, loan syndication, derivatives, and global cash management services; equity and fixed income sales and trading, and underwriting services; and construction machinery, transportation equipment, industrial machinery, medical equipment, and other leasing services. The Global Markets Business Unit segment provides asset liability management and portfolio management, foreign currency funding, and sales and trading services. The company offers system development, data processing, management consulting, economic research, and asset management services. Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group, Inc. was incorporated in 2002 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Toru  Nakashima | President, Group CEO, Representative Corporate Executive Officer & Director | Age 62 | Compensation: $1.1M (FY2026)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 123K people. Each employee generates $148K of free cash flow annually.","financial_summary":["Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group is a large-cap financial services business with a $145.6B market cap.","The business throws off $18.3B in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 5.94\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.2\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 1.8%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 77% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Large open-market insider purchases (net $626.3M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Among the least levered in Financial Services \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Japan\u2019s SBI Holdings, SMFG, and Solana Foundation Launch \u201cSBI Solana Global\u201d Joint Venture","source":"coinidol.com","link":"https://coinidol.com/japan-solana-venture/","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795647960.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Sumitomo Mitsui Financial Group Revises Q1 FY2026 English Comprehensive Income Figure","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/sumitomo-mitsui-financial-group-revises-q1-fy2026-english-comprehensive-income-figure","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795777965.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.25,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Gemini AI Picks Which Could Double First in 2027: Bitcoin, Ethereum or Solana","source":"247wallst.com","link":"https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/27/gemini-ai-picks-which-could-double-first-in-2027-bitcoin-ethereum-or-solana/","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795802849.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"UK FCA Plans Strict DeFi Rules as Coinbase and Aave Push Back","source":"news.bitcoin.com","link":"https://news.bitcoin.com/defi/uk-fca-plans-strict-defi-rules-as-coinbase-and-aave-push-